Modifications:
- pyproject.toml: OpenUSD is built from source on aarch64 Linux (spark/build_openusd.sh); no aarch64 wheel exists.
- src/articraft/agent/provider/openrouter.py, src/articraft/settings.py, src/articraft/api.py,
  src/articraft/app.py, .env.example, docs/providers.md: drive a local OpenAI-compatible server
  (base URL, optional key, image input, output cap, chat-template arguments, image pruning, and a
  per-turn thinking budget enforced by the client).
- src/articraft/agent/harness.py, src/articraft/agent/record.py: keep the last clean compile when a
  run reaches its turn limit.
- src/articraft/agent/tools/: write refuses a small rewrite of a file the run already wrote.
- tests/: tests for the above.
- spark/: new; install, serve, demo, scoring, verification and rendering scripts for an NVIDIA DGX Spark.
- README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md: new.

Third-party content included here:
- spark/bench/dresser/reference.png is a crop of a photograph from Pixabay (https://pixabay.com),
  used under the Pixabay Content License. It is the reference image every run in this repository was
  given. See spark/bench/dresser/README.md.
- Everything under spark/results/ is recorded output of runs described in the README, including
  Python written by the model. It is evidence, not maintained source.

The model weights are not part of this repository. RedHatAI/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NVFP4,
